WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.080 --> 00:00:03.030
Madinah, the year 632.

2
00:00:03.080 --> 00:00:05.370
The Prophet Muhammad has died.

3
00:00:05.420 --> 00:00:08.080
Muslims believe he was the last prophet.

4
00:00:08.130 --> 00:00:10.090
Revelation has ended.

5
00:00:10.140 --> 00:00:13.300
But a young community still
needs someone to lead prayer,

6
00:00:13.350 --> 00:00:15.930
keep unity and judge disputes.

7
00:00:15.980 --> 00:00:17.850
So who should lead next?

8
00:00:17.900 --> 00:00:21.220
And why does the answer
still divide Muslims today?

9
00:00:21.270 --> 00:00:23.780
In this mission, you'll hear two accounts:

10
00:00:23.830 --> 00:00:27.900
one of a meeting hall, one of
a stop called Ghadir Khumm.

11
00:00:27.950 --> 00:00:30.880
Then you'll weigh up which
account is better supported,

12
00:00:30.930 --> 00:00:32.600
and by what evidence.

13
00:00:32.650 --> 00:00:37.270
Your mission: find out how Muslims
answered the question of who should lead,

14
00:00:37.320 --> 00:00:39.080
and why it still matters.
